  id: base_dread_firestorm
  title: Firestorm
  description: This spell transforms the room the caster is in into a blazing inferno,
    dealing 3 health points of damage to all heroes and monsters present. The caster
    is unaffected. Each victim then rolls 2 red dice. For every 5 or 6 rolled, the
    damage is reduced by 1. Cannot be used in a corridor.
